Are you someone who enjoys physical work and are you looking for a full-time position in day shift? Then we have a great opportunity for you! For Dorel Juvenile in Helmond, we are looking for a motivated Loader & Unloader who is ready to roll up their sleeves.Together with your colleagues, you will ensure that goods are processed correctly and efficiently. You will stay active throughout the day and play an important role in the logistics process.

What will you do?

- Loading and unloading trucks;
- Checking and processing incoming goods;
- Packing and preparing outgoing shipments for dispatch;
- Storing products in the correct warehouse locations;
- Assisting with stock counts and inventory management;
- Maintaining a neat, safe, and organized working environment.

- You speak Dutch or English;
- You are physically fit and enjoy active work;
- You can travel independently to Helmond;
- You are available for day shifts from 08:00 AM to 04:30 PM;
- Experience in logistics is a plus, but not required.
